WEBVTT

00:00:06.992 --> 00:00:11.961
Meet LATYS. Every AI coding agent you use, in one command center.

00:00:12.561 --> 00:00:17.706
Start by connecting the agents you already have. Each one installs with a single command.

00:00:18.961 --> 00:00:23.210
Launch any agent. Each one gets a codename you can call by name.

00:00:24.761 --> 00:00:28.384
Give it a task, and watch it work, live, in a real terminal.

00:00:33.361 --> 00:00:38.500
Press Control K to launch agents, run commands, or message every agent at once.

00:00:40.761 --> 00:00:44.608
Or just say it. Voice runs entirely on your own machine.

00:00:47.161 --> 00:00:52.074
Hand off a whole mission. LATYS picks the agents, and keeps them working until it's done.

00:00:53.361 --> 00:00:58.623
Then review every change, run your tests, and preview the result, right inside LATYS.

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:04.726
And when you want company, chat with other builders in the community.

00:01:09.161 --> 00:01:10.210
Make it yours.

00:01:19.311 --> 00:01:21.816
LATYS. Your AI command center.

